---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">About</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-4 text-gray-300">
      <p>Hi! I'm the person behind annotatedcatastrophe.</p>
      <p>This site is a personal hub for my creative projects and tools. It includes a hex map maker for TTRPGs, simple messaging, a blog, and links to my other projects like the custom calendar generator.</p>
      <p>Most of these tools are free, no-account-required, and built with curiosity as the main motivator.</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-purple-400">Tech</h2>
      <p>Built with Astro, Tailwind CSS, and Supabase. Hosted on Vercel. Code on GitHub.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
